<title>SWITZERLAND: Spanin's Juan Carlos to visit Switzerland.</title>
<headline>Spanin's Juan Carlos to visit Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's King Juan Carlos will visit Switzerland on November 6 to receive the Johann Wolfgang von Goethe Foundation's Jean Monnet Prize for commitment to European integration, the foreign ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The king will also meet Swiss government officials to discuss Switzerland's bilateral ties with the European Union, European security issues and the December summit of the Organisation for Security and Cooperation in Europe.</p>
</text>
